{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/786426-2-5-sidereal-help-evading-the-spider-s-eyes","id":786426,"title":"(2.5) Sidereal Help - Evading the Spider's Eyes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-14T19:08:46-08:00","id":786426,"title":"(2.5) Sidereal Help - Evading the Spider's Eyes","content":"I need some assistance. <br /> <br /> <br /> Does anyone know any method to work around the Lunar Charm &quot;Evading the Spider's Eye&quot; from page 175 of the Errata?<br /> <br /> This Charm has become my bane as a Sidereal, where my RD's are instantly blown because this charm that has days-long duration is up by some Lunars at all times. <br /> <br /> Halp?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3052-blackshade10","name":"blackshade10","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T20:56:42-08:00","id":786479,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately it looks like your best bet there is, if you suspect a Lunar detecting you is going to be problematic, use mundane disguises without a resplendent destiny. Now, granted, your ST may be the more problematic part by deciding to add it to their paranoia suite, but the simplest answer is 'don't have astrology around to be obvious'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/756-meianno-yuurei","name":"Meianno Yuurei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T21:54:27-08:00","id":786504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Meianno Yuurei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/786426-2-5-sidereal-help-evading-the-spider-s-eyes?p=786479#post786479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately it looks like your best bet there is, if you suspect a Lunar detecting you is going to be problematic, use mundane disguises without a resplendent destiny. Now, granted, your ST may be the more problematic part by deciding to add it to their paranoia suite, but the simplest answer is 'don't have astrology around to be obvious'.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Intensely frustrating.<br /> <br /> OK, new plan then.<br /> <br /> <br /> Any tips on how to max out my disguise ability to the nth degree? I've already got Disguise of the New Face, and am a master of Throne Shadow.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> P.S. Anyway you know of to wear Armor of the Unseen Assassin, but effectively create an illusion over the armor to make it appear that I am not wearing the armor?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3052-blackshade10","user":"blackshade10","date":". 12-15-2015, 12:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3052-blackshade10","name":"blackshade10","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}